# oracle: pair_style comb3 polar_off on pure Cu fcc, 4x4x4 cells (256 atoms, ffield.comb3 entry Cu Cu Cu, all charges 0) with a 0.05 A random displacement: run 0, then 20 NVE steps; per-atom forces of the final state (dump) and thermo rows
# native: installed lmp (b332f28 build, which includes COMB3; no separate build). Measured error (engine vs native): worst per-atom force relative error 1.55e-14 (atom 145 fy, after 20 steps); worst thermo relative error about 1e-14 (step 0, etotal). The 1e-8 target holds on every row.
# oracle-potentials: ffield.comb3
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10 atomrel=1e-8
units		metal
atom_style	charge
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
lattice  	fcc 3.615
region		box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box	1 box
create_atoms	1 box
mass		1 63.546
displace_atoms  all random 0.05 0.05 0.05 4417 units box
pair_style	comb3 polar_off
pair_coeff	* * ffield.comb3 Cu
neighbor	2.0 bin
neigh_modify	every 1 delay 0 check yes
fix		1 all nve
timestep        0.00020
thermo_style	custom step temp etotal pe evdwl ecoul press vol lx ly lz
thermo_modify	norm yes format float %.15g
thermo		10
run		0
run		20
